[{"title":"雪夜思南山禅友","author":"德祥","text":"夕雪洒虚堂，禅身懒下床。\n楮衾清不暖，蜡烛冷无光。\n宿鸟争枝响，寒花上路香。\n南山有兄弟，岁晚不能忘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":25,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望雪","author":"德祥","text":"早起雪初晴，百鸟无一声。\n吾门政冷落，老眼借光明。\n独立望何极，溪山如此清。\n唯应剡中棹，昨夜有人行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":26,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崔彦晖小隐","author":"德祥","text":"茅堂不近城，风景见高情。\n溪上山多异，门前水独清。\n晚云双鹭入，春树一鸡鸣。\n恐有庞夫子，同于此地耕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋塘","author":"德祥","text":"独步秋塘上，其如客思何。\n蝉声送风叶，鸟影度凉波。\n草店三家酒，菱船一道歌。\n不堪回首处，杨柳夕阳多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":28,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小筑","author":"德祥","text":"日涉东园上，馀将卜此居。\n草生桥断处，花落燕来初。\n避俗何求僻，容身不愿馀。\n堂成三亩地，只有一车书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":29,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听雨有怀","author":"德祥","text":"洒树声兼雪，稍檐力借风。\n每来寒夜后，多在客愁中。\n草意闲门共，灯情白发同。\n之人天一角，的的似高鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":30,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵朗元白所寄","author":"德祥","text":"自来溪里住，家计逐年增。\n日煮三窠菜，时供一个僧。\n坐禅非所习，看话亦无能。\n只么随缘过，如何继祖灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":31,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"易门","author":"德祥","text":"背溪开北户，别路出西林。\n熟客也须问，游僧未得寻。\n庭中闲草色，园内老莺吟。\n尽日无人事，犹嫌住少深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":32,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜归赋此以寄东田隐士","author":"德祥","text":"触热嫌寻访，闭门如路穷。\n手持东野集，思与何人同。\n候雨坐檐树，听蝉得晚风。\n因之过林叟，归步月明中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":33,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新秋有怀","author":"德祥","text":"得秋方一日，秋意已纷纷。\n凉觉水边早，声先树里闻。\n高僧在西岭，短策不离云。\n我欲寻行迹，恐惊鸾鹤群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":34,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送北禅讲师","author":"德祥","text":"秦淮一相见，云鹤两闲身。\n共爱青萝寺，俱为白发人。\n楚江花后别，吴苑雨中春。\n今日因师去，莼乡梦又新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧之松溪寺","author":"德祥","text":"师去松溪寺，应添景更清。\n洗溪留竹影，扫院著松声。\n鸟就阶前宿，云从席上生。\n老予无所住，于此亦多情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":36,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秀溪送僧住水西","author":"德祥","text":"此水异诸水，何来入此城？\n源应多秀色，流亦有清声。\n古寺在其上，高僧今独行。\n藤枝挂萝壁，于此度群生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":37,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧归荆州","author":"德祥","text":"上人归洞庭，衣带浙山青。\n秋院空荆树，凉风度楚汀。\n闻钟还驻锡，在路亦持经。\n乡士知高行，谈玄处处听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":38,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贻息耘隐士 其一","author":"德祥","text":"髭鬓多年雪，交情百炼金。\n青山楼上坐，白鸟树中吟。\n行路畏相识，寻僧说此心。\n欲将白云画，归挂草堂深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":39,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贻息耘隐士 其二","author":"德祥","text":"棣萼情相并，鸥波梦一如。\n草堂春悄悄，莺木雨疏疏。\n破酒频邀汝，评诗累过馀。\n丹基有馀地，容结小茅庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":40,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贻息耘隐士 其三","author":"德祥","text":"三五树萧萧，幽居称寂寥。\n去年存菊本，来客问松苗。\n挂梦寒山寺，留踪野雪桥。\n一枝栖息稳，分得与鹪鹩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":41,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送莲峰昶晦元书记","author":"德祥","text":"一住莲峰下，看松过十年。\n行寻无路草，不饮出山泉。\n虎共空林雪，猿同静夜禅。\n时将新得句，歌送碧云边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":42,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雪有怀湛然禅师","author":"德祥","text":"东风游约近，积雪闭门深。\n兴或有时到，春应无处寻。\n柳藏初活眼，草没未灰心。\n寂寞南山下，茶烟出树林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":43,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧游东林","author":"德祥","text":"见说浔阳去，炉峰似见之。\n雪埋天际石，泉出寺中池。\n梦是劳倾想，愁非惜别离。\n休师两度到，应只为题诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":44,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为圆上人赋雪洞","author":"德祥","text":"禅室虚生白，居之最吉祥。\n了经何待月，上鬓不知霜。\n宿恐云来借，寒愁火有妨。\n老僧接息久，无复梦华阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":45,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹所为馀杭教谕王志学题兼贻主薄","author":"德祥","text":"王维竹里馆，今复见诸孙。\n翰简传来久，名园几处存。\n鸟歌烟际石，花覆月中门。\n高士轩多暇，时能共一樽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":46,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送延庆讲师","author":"德祥","text":"萧然山下寺，讲席称清才。\n路对湖中入，门依树里开。\n老夫莼兴动，霜降橘书来。\n珍重矶头石，留予一片苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":47,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中怀王仲高","author":"德祥","text":"久病不出队，不出难自存。\n大雪断行路，乱山深闭门。\n瓮番饥鼠走，竹折冻禽喧。\n政忆王夫子，清斋咬菜根。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":48,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题镇海楼","author":"德祥","text":"斯楼屡易名，一上一伤情。\n白屋多为戍，青山半作城。\n雨中春树出，风里晚潮生。\n亦有归鸦早，闲鸣四五声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":49,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中留宿息耘轩话旧","author":"德祥","text":"宿雨青林里，春灯白发前。\n老交无几几，别话有千千。\n坐久情生草，听多梦入船。\n直须开酒律，相醉尽馀年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":50,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题王仲高林泉小像","author":"德祥","text":"家有青箱学，流传子又孙。\n诗曾留竹里，梦不到槐根。\n岁月饶双鬓，溪山付一樽。\n老怀无所系，时得访沙门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":51,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧归天台住国清寺","author":"德祥","text":"闻说台山胜，令人梦欲腾。\n松杉万丈路，鉼锡半千僧。\n涧落烟中磐，岩垂雪里灯。\n丰干旧时席，花雨又重增。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":52,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与兰古春在京重见","author":"德祥","text":"胜刹住吴淞，名缁亦景从。\n怪来成罢讲，偶地得相逢。\n白发多时镜，青山几处钟。\n如今不用别，老去托芙蓉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":53,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送止无传住车溪东塔","author":"德祥","text":"车溪古法席，子可继先贤。\n薜荔林间锡，芙蓉浦口船。\n鸟声青嶂里，灯影白头前。\n我有乞归日，于斯尽暮年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":54,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送一源藏主行脚","author":"德祥","text":"之子事行脚，正当年少时。\n汲瓶寻活水，挂锡选高枝。\n山向多边看，云从几处期。\n西湖柳花里，欲别更迟迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":55,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠沈景玉","author":"德祥","text":"水接僧居近，林开市路通。\n绿云生宿雨，黄鸟出晴风。\n世事书声外，交情道味中。\n高踪沈东老，能与一樽同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":56,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林泉归隐图","author":"德祥","text":"居山岂为山，只爱此中闲。\n野菜何消种，柴门不要关。\n饭余听涧落，经罢看云还。\n恐有寒山句，多题藓石间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":57,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雨首座还山中","author":"德祥","text":"厌客已三年，还家一怅然。\n挂藤空壁上，扫叶旧房前。\n老鹤先归树，寒鱼也出泉。\n吾将洗苔石，与尔共安禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":58,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄姚隐居","author":"德祥","text":"种桑不似种花多，丈八清沟尽种荷。\n燕子门前三树柳，桃花溪里一群鹅。\n生来不作黄粱梦，老去偏工《白雪》歌。\n亦欲买山相近住，不论时节要相过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":59,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春闻角","author":"德祥","text":"一声霜角起谯楼，归念纷纷不自由。\n驿使几回来庾岭，诗人谁复在扬州。\n啼乌城郭春前曙，唳雁江天雪未休。\n冷落东风花莫恨，吹开杨柳又多愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":60,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"颍人来得马仲祯消息作诗寄之","author":"德祥","text":"海上相逢说颍州，古来名郡著名流。\n欧苏遗迹犹堪访，管鲍交情或可求。\n晚照牛羊新陇亩，秋风鸿雁旧沙洲。\n一尊乡酒谁同会，应有平生马少游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":61,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游天龙寺","author":"德祥","text":"群山江上走蜿蜒，直引潮声到寺前。\n楼阁下头生雨气，树林高处出香烟。\n流传只守千家钵，受用单承一指禅。\n白发老僧东塔住，自言将及赵州年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":62,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日西园","author":"德祥","text":"新筑西园小草堂，熟时无处可乘凉。\n池塘六月由来浅，林木三年未得长。\n欲净身心频扫地，爱开窗户不烧香。\n晚风只有溪南柳，又畏蝉声闹夕阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":63,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵衍斯道九日同登凤山","author":"德祥","text":"云逢水遇片时间，燕北鸿南两未闲。\n今日偶然成握手，重阳难得共登山。\n岂知白发翻多事，相对黄花觉厚颜。\n惆怅不堪回望处，群鸦飞尽暮潮还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":64,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听雨篷","author":"德祥","text":"溪边茅屋两三椽，宽窄其如一钓船。\n几树暮鸥篷底看，一瓢春酒雨中眠。\n旧愁无复来心上，新梦何由到枕边。\n我亦江湖钓竿手，菰蒲丛里住多年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":65,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄馀复初炼师","author":"德祥","text":"昆峰峭峭玉丛丛，有意寻仙到此中。\n流水年华逢甲子，秋风城郭见丁公。\n门前丹气无人识，洞里棋声有路通。\n借得古松同鹤住，共看尘世事匆匆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":66,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题庄氏书楼","author":"德祥","text":"三尺枯桐挂此楼，楼中人似晋风流。\n酒杯春到休教歇，书册年来尽要收。\n柳色半边溪水上，莺声一片晚风头。\n满怀清思无消处，月过楼西坐未休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":67,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别吴江老友","author":"德祥","text":"江湖分得两平平，九里长塘一片城。\n红叶树边停舫子，白鸥群里听钟声。\n晨星故旧尝时数，春草诗情触处生。\n岁事欲阑言别事，直烧灯烛到天明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":68,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵同复翁雪中暮归","author":"德祥","text":"撩乱云中半掩扉，忍寒冲雪晚同归。\n回溪尚有多人渡，过岭都无一鸟飞。\n木叶风声听去别，芦花月色看来非。\n普贤大士修何行，不与群生愿少违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":69,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访息耘不遇","author":"德祥","text":"语声了了出溪湾，只隔桃波一步间。\n自爱黄鹂春后至，多愁燕子雨中还。\n坡晴细草平如剪，花曙闲门半不关。\n欲觅行踪云满地，人言采药在他山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":70,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与侄自京还横塘故居","author":"德祥","text":"桑麻田在水村中，千里归来共阿戎。\n春水野航天上下，石桥林木岸西东。\n阶除点火儿童喜，兄弟开门语笑同。\n三载客尘如梦事，明朝溪上看飞鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":71,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠陈士宁次息耘先生韵","author":"德祥","text":"一片尘中隙地幽，住来谁得共悠悠。\n青苔巷小长关雨，红叶墙低直见秋。\n斗茗约同萝石畔，买船停在竹溪头。\n邻翁怪底无羁者，排日闲忙亦有由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":72,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵赠马仲祯全斯立二昆仲","author":"德祥","text":"客鬓吟髯并雪霜，相看总为惜流光。\n鹤同丁令身千岁，蝶与庄生梦一床。\n济世药壶长自负，游山酒榼不时将。\n两心得似孤云片，来往家山几树傍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":73,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为常上人题在山图","author":"德祥","text":"一坞如山看数日，山山看尽又重看。\n年来木石同心性，老去烟霞入肺肝。\n春草涧深流水歇，夕阳钟早宿禽安。\n为僧只合于斯住，些子尘中事不干。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":74,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过湖州","author":"德祥","text":"平生只想住湖州，僻性迂情可自由。\n一片水声中倚杖，几重山色裹行舟。\n东林书卷贫犹买，西塞纶竿老未收。\n缓得归程过寒食，杏花村雨听鸣鸠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":75,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪居","author":"德祥","text":"红叶如花翠竹低，风烟重叠护幽栖。\n午鸡喔喔连他境，一犬嘹嘹隔此溪。\n秋水放船天上下，夕阳倚杖陌东西。\n如何野店山桥外，又送行人过马蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":76,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄竺庵之中天竺","author":"德祥","text":"花外床琴坐不休，满怀风露思迟留。\n凄凉蟋蟀声中月，断送梧桐叶上秋。\n幽梦每随草春入，尺书还寄暮鸿愁。\n思君桂子新凉夜，正在天香第几楼？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":77,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"螺川送别图","author":"德祥","text":"五老峰前送别图，社贤今日未应无。\n路经黄叶千年寺，人倚西风十幅蒲。\n铜斗旧歌闻楚甸，莼羹新兴入吴都。\n重山复水闲踪迹，自在飞云一片孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":78,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与董子章宿江上","author":"德祥","text":"啼螀力尽月初斜，客鬓因秋半欲华。\n霜气著人唯隔纸，滩声聒梦即浮槎。\n伤歌宁戚牛谁饭，懒性嵇康虱自爬。\n明日风烟各回首，江头红叶胜开花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":79,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜友过新居","author":"德祥","text":"柴门不向小溪开，西阜山多称不才。\n拄丈前村新雨后，故人东郭买舟来。\n山瓢远慰何多幸，竹径相逢第一回。\n从此熟来溪上路，莫教行迹有莓苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":80,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭荣竹方","author":"德祥","text":"檐竹萧萧雨建瓴，无由复此对床听。\n灯花影落空棋局，墨汁香消冷研屏。\n春水池塘新旧草，东风杨柳短长亭。\n伤心一段交期梦，又被寒江鹤唤醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":81,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为马仲祯题一湾烟水","author":"德祥","text":"占得沙河水一湾，此身能与狎鸥闲。\n桃花断岸无船到，杨柳衡门尽日关。\n千里烟波归老眼，十年魂梦入乡山。\n扁舟西塞山前路，流水肥鱼待尔还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":82,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荆溪有怀","author":"德祥","text":"荆溪一壑旧风烟，鸥鹭盟中念昔贤。\n春水田畴苏玉局，夕阳庭树杜樊川。\n鸡声呖呖荒村外，鸟路迢迢暮霭边。\n欲觅高僧问南岳，碧云西望草芊芊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":83,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起观书诀","author":"德祥","text":"三十年馀翰墨中，一编书诀伴衰翁。\n赐丹曾起元常疾，旧冢宁论智永功。\n碧海鱼龙春自化，故山猿鹤梦谁同。\n如今短杖残阳里，闲数秋空断阵鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":84,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"故宫井","author":"德祥","text":"上有千尺桐，下有千尺井。\n风吹井上桐，零落井中影。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":85,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵张一笑秋思","author":"德祥","text":"闲庭凉思晚悠悠，谁遣诗人到水头。\n两岸蝉声西照里，岂容杨柳不先秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":86,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风雨","author":"德祥","text":"风雨闭门三十日，年光虚度一分春。\n凄凉旧国莺花梦，白发江南有几人？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":87,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿吕城","author":"德祥","text":"吕城街里听鸡鸣，岂料三年在上京。\n风雨凄凄今又听，旧时双耳旧鸡声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":88,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天平圭禅师书至赋诗答之 其一","author":"德祥","text":"西山鸾鹤少因缘，只向天平住一年。\n无限别来惆怅事，紫藤花落寺门前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":89,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天平圭禅师书至赋诗答之","author":"德祥","text":"姑苏城下别兵前，水北云南事可怜。\n一纸书来开不得，伤心犹恐说当年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":90,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题顾定之竹画","author":"德祥","text":"吴下曾逢顾定之，十年长记别来时。\n萧萧白发江南思，谁解尊前唱《竹枝》？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":91,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雪","author":"德祥","text":"江南二月正多春，雨雪痴酣似醉人。\n迷杀北归江上雁，百花楼外一声新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":92,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送僧还义兴简聪闻复","author":"德祥","text":"别却铜山三十年，因师长忆旧风烟。\n今朝忽送东归客，正是秋江落木前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":93,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春江送僧图为芳上人题","author":"德祥","text":"唤得春船柳岸头，欲行犹更话绸缪。\n水云踪迹明朝夜，又听钟声那寺楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":94,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]